@startuml
title 4. Telephony outbox publishing

participant Scheduler
participant "Outbox publisher" as Publisher
database Outbox
queue Kafka

Scheduler -> Publisher: calls:telephony-outbox:publish
Publisher -> Outbox: claim due records\ncanceled_at is null

loop claimed commands
    Publisher -> Kafka: publish command\nkey=external_call_id
    alt publish ok
        Publisher -> Outbox: status=published
    else publish failed and retry remains
        Publisher -> Outbox: status=pending\navailable later
    else attempts exhausted
        Publisher -> Outbox: status=failed
    end
end

note right of Outbox
  PostgreSQL claim uses UPDATE ... RETURNING.
  Portable fallback rereads after claim.
end note

@enduml
